The two .EXE files are both in ZIP-format. That means they are compressed. Normally
this results in Files with ending .ZIP. Since not everybody has PKZIP, or PKUNZIP for
that matter, PK programmed another binary that can be added to a .ZIP-file. Together
with this additional file a self-extracting .EXE-file results. Actually you don't need
INSTALL.BAT, you could start both .EXE-files for themselves. This would result in the
normal additional files like oracles, rumors, tower1..3, etc. and NETHACK.000 and 
NETHACK.001. You would now have to concatenate these two files with COPY *.00* *.EXE.

